<title>USA: Belmont Bancorp Q3 shr down with SAIF.</title>
<headline>Belmont Bancorp Q3 shr down with SAIF.</headline>
<dateline>ST. CLAIRSVILLE, Ohio 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.50		    $0.57</p>
<p> Net			  1,083		    1,220</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.70		    $1.54</p>
<p> Net			  3,657		    3,324</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Total assets at September 30, 1996, were $349.32 million versus $321.39 million at September 30, 1995.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 net includes a one-time, pre-tax charge of $397,000 as its assessment to replenish the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Belmont Bancorp is the parent company of Belmont National Bank</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
